{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/extras/raraBOOM_playthedemo.gif?t=1748567930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up for 4-player co-op action with a modern twist! Ra Ra BOOM rockets you to a future Earth overrun by rogue AI. Battle waves of enemies and upgrade your ninja cheerleader\u2019s skills as you beat \u2018em up, shoot \u2018em up, and smash through the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/extras/raraboom-vs-boss.mp4.gif?t=1748567930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your pom poms and hop into the first level of Ra Ra BOOM today! See how this wild adventure to reclaim Earth begins. Play as Aris, Vee, Saida, or Ren either solo or locally with up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy your time with Ra Ra, please <strong>Wishlist</strong> and leave a review!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2933340?t=1748567930","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/465f8d120c541c01ff4398ae33d7d6ef71dbfa23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748567930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/0ada1de4160997fd116713ee47b4fc8ac11ba1d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748567930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/0ada1de4160997fd116713ee47b4fc8ac11ba1d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748567930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/extras/raraBOOM_playthedemo.gif?t=1748567930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up for 4-player co-op action with a modern twist! Ra Ra BOOM rockets you to a future Earth overrun by rogue AI. Battle waves of enemies and upgrade your ninja cheerleader\u2019s skills as you beat \u2018em up, shoot \u2018em up, and smash through the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/extras/raraboom-vs-boss.mp4.gif?t=1748567930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your pom poms and hop into the first level of Ra Ra BOOM today! See how this wild adventure to reclaim Earth begins. Play as Aris, Vee, Saida, or Ren either solo or locally with up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy your time with Ra Ra, please <strong>Wishlist</strong> and leave a review!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Gylee Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2335060","name":"Ra Ra BOOM"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933340/55930a55ce388994f21372486216ef1015611b60/header.jpg?t=1748567930","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Gylee, LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><